    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>Provides a named signal that can be routed to a corresponding Label Sink or exported as an external input label.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
