    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>OUTPUT block.</li>
      <li>Looks up a labelSink with the same name and forwards that sink input when available.</li>
      <li>If the name or connection is missing, the output is not changed.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = \mathrm{labeled\ signal}</latex>
